{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_08_beg",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_08",
  "title": "嘉维尔之拳",
  "storyCode": "RI-8",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "af8790ddbcab67da8ac3bcef19b1b61280f968c1c8171d7eebbfa77d8ee08fa6",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "text": "这里的楼房跟其他部族明显不一样了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "text": "破房子！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "唔，这里的建筑和装饰好粗糙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "不过奇怪的器械残骸到处都是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "text": "祖玛玛，你的部族建设得挺特别啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "text": "看来他们也和你一样喜欢捣鼓机器了嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "这都是我的族人们的杰作。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "嗯。他们也都体会到了机械的魅力，凭借着自己的热情将这个部族建设到了现在这个样子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
      "text": "快看，是嘉维尔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人B",
      "text": "大酋长说的是真的，她要用大丑和嘉维尔再进行一次对决。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人C",
      "text": "什么？！这怎么能错过！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "text": "哇，好多人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "这些人里有不少是在祭典后聚集到这里来的其他部族的人，他们也将会加入我们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "text": "哦，所以你要说些什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "嘉维尔，原本如果你就那么离开的话，我不会管你。但是你既然你又站在我的面前，那么我就要在这里打倒你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "text": "为什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "因为你太强了，嘉维尔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "你还记得那一天吗，嘉维尔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "text": "那一天？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "在那天之前，我和你一样，坚信自己的拳头就是一切。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "text": "嘿！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "哇啊啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯老人",
      "text": "嘉维尔胜！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "text": "哈哈，我又赢了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "哼，再来，下次我一定会赢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "text": "好呀！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "咦，大地怎么在震动？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "text": "看，是那边！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "那......那是什么啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "text": "好大的铁块！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯老人",
      "text": "那是萨尔贡的移动城市......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "萨尔贡是什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯老人",
      "text": "萨尔贡是我们的国家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "移动城市又是什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯老人",
      "text": "移动城市就是很大的部族，在上面住着许多人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯老人",
      "text": "我也是年轻时有一次上去看到过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯老人",
      "text": "好了，别害怕，它不会开过来的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯老人",
      "text": "那是和我们一辈子都没关系的东西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "text": "祖玛玛，你怎么了，身体不舒服吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "没什么，我先回去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "text": "哦，我记得啊，萨尔贡的移动城市正好开过了我们这里附近嘛，从那天之后你就变得怪怪的了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "我反而觉得不可思议，嘉维尔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "看到那样的东西，难道不会觉得惊讶吗？不会觉得震撼吗？不会觉得自己渺小吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "text": "你问我那天的感受，那确实是觉得“哇，好大啊”，可是那和我有什么关系？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "你总是这样，嘉维尔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "在那天之后，我就对和你打架失去了兴趣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "我拜托依娜姆帮我寻找和机械有关的书籍，开始学习萨尔贡语和机械知识。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "然后我遇到了大祭司，我们两个人开始一起制造大丑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "text": "这我知道啊，我不是还去找过你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "text": "嗯？这么说来，那边那只怪家伙就是你的隐形朋友？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "没错！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "哇，什么时候到我身边来的！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "总觉得跟大帝老板一样......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "大帝？你是说那只企鹅吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "是的，咦，你认识老板吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "认识认识，当然认识，虽然我们大概有几十年没见面了，咦，是几十年吗？还是几百年？算了，反正你身上确实有那家伙的气味。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "几百年是怎么回事啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "诶诶诶，没想到老板在这里还有朋友！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "text": "原来你真的存在啊，我一直以为是祖玛玛脑子出问题了出现了幻觉，在罗德岛的时候我还专门研究过类似的病症咧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "噢，你不知道，嘉维尔，小时候你来找祖玛玛的时候，我一直在旁边看着！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "就像这样！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "text": "消失了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "哈哈哈，我平时是不会出现在你们的面前的，但是现在要驾驶大丑，所以就没办法啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "不过跟小家伙们一起造机器还是挺有趣的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "说到大丑，你不去驾驶真的没关系吗？我看要撞到房子了诶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "啊？啊，我忘了！那等会儿聊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "呜哇，真的一下子又回到驾驶席了，好厉害啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "果然和老板一样......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "text": "哦，差点忘了你还在说话。不过老实说，祖玛玛，反正最后都要打一架，你说这些真的有必要吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "这些话是说给你听的，也是说给我自己听的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "你知道吗，嘉维尔，对我来说，你是最大的阻碍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "text": "啊？是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "确切地说，不是你，而是你这样的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "我曾经试图想要说服许多人去了解机器的魅力，但是最终，他们中有绝大多数都不感兴趣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "因为有你这样厉害的人在给他们做榜样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "你这样的存在告诉他们，在这里，能打就能够获得想要的东西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "你的强大，堵死了前进的道路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "所以我下定决心，我要打破人们的这种想法，我要用更强的力量，摧毁你建立起的这种对自身力量的盲目崇拜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "诶，博士，我觉得她说的蛮有道理的啊，你觉得呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "确实。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "text": "博士，你到底是帮哪边的啊！",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可颂",
              "text": "虽然确实有道理，但是又好像有哪里不对......",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "机器不错。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "煌",
              "text": "对啊，那个大家伙酷诶！",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "不过老实说，我也快要被你说服了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "但是我也没想做大家的榜样啊，我只代表我自己，我觉得拳头可以解决一切，关别人什么事。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "我知道，这不怪你。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "但是，我依然决心打败你，嘉维尔，用这大丑的力量。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "所有人听好了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "下面，大丑将和嘉维尔重新进行一次决斗。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "这场战斗将真正决定谁才是真正的大酋长！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "大祭司，要战斗了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "噢，没问题！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "嘉维尔，准备好了吗！让你的同伴一起上也没关系！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "我都已经等不及了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "你们别来插手，这一战，我要亲手打倒这个大家伙！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "来吧！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "先试试正常功率！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "我射！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "嘿，别以为能炸到我第二次！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "噢，不愧是嘉维尔，出色的反应神经！但是没关系，尝尝我的巨大铁拳！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "拼力气？我喜欢！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
          "text": "嘉维尔，好厉害！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可颂",
          "text": "嘉维尔太厉害了！居然一个人扛住了这个大家伙的铁拳！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "宴",
          "text": "虽然我体检时就有过这样的疑问了，她为什么会是医疗干员啊？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "......虽然是敌人，但我都要忍不住为你喝彩了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "但是但是，这还没有完呢！为了应付这种情况，大丑可是有功率全开的模式的！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "我按！",
          "portraitKey": null
