        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "什么？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "宴",
          "text": "那个大家伙的力气好像变得更大了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "嘉维尔的力量被比下去了？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "啊，多么动听的声音！......嗯？等等，表盘好像有点不对......嗯嗯嗯？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "大祭司，情况怎么样了？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "哇哦，我感觉我的屁股要被烤焦了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "我是问你大丑的情况！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "哦，我只是顺便说一下我的状况！我觉得是引擎功率太大，大丑开始暴走了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "感觉还挺刺激的！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "你先出来！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "不是要战斗吗？就这么战斗吧！来吧，嘉维尔，让我就这么解决——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "大祭司！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "哦，好吧，真遗憾，看来我需要改变策略。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "祖玛玛，不用担心我，我来尽可能稳住它，在这个期间让大丑停下来吧！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "......嘉维尔，你们先走吧，这与你们无关。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "说什么呢，你不是要打败我吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "我会打败你，但不是用这种方式。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "哎呀，别这么见外，我当然要帮忙了，对吧，博士？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
          "text": "打大怪兽！我来帮忙！",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
